### POST Without Description
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 5,
  "user": "sandra",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z"
}

### POST a too long Description
POST {{host}}/api/Tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 6,
  "user": "sandra",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z",
  "description": "Monitor flickers and my emails are full of spam, also my mouse is slow and i can't see my second monitor, and i told you about this already because this is your fault and why am i seeing ads for shaving cream I thought i told you not to include me in such ads I want no ads well maybe for barbeque sauce but I guess you can't fix that, can you? Anyway how is margareth? fishing this weekend? Am i over 500 characters yet? I am not counting. I don't like counting. I always lose track. But fix my pc and the internet and the ads please, that is your job."
}

### POST with deadline is before date of issue
POST {{host}}/api/Tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "id": 50,
  "user": "Test User",
  "dateOfIssue": "2026-11-12T10:00:00Z",
  "dateOfDeadline": "2026-11-10T10:00:00Z",
  "description": "Deadline is two days before the issue date."
}

### GET Diagnostics (operation ID)
GET {{host}}/api/Diagnostics
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Test Endpoint that throws
GET {{host}}/api/Diagnostics/throw
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}